  "html": "<div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-36ea0553-5d96-48d5-8899-d32879566748\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7e5b9e46-4880-468c-b104-32b0bb706697\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-965f462a-281d-48f3-970b-57d9dd9c099d\">가슴 확대 수술은 보형물을 가슴 안에 삽입하는 수술로, 이를 위해 반드시 절개가 필요합니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2d205e42-a75a-4c22-be2a-72186170b96c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-a622524c-b917-4eca-adff-900bed0a8a37\">현재 성형외과에서 주로 사용되는 절개 방법은 다음과 같이 네 가지로 나눌 수 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-faa65f98-5fe0-4bac-8d29-f74c152da408\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-59df2aa4-41a2-458d-a61d-a2c6947f5d05\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4205df40-d282-43bf-8a11-443bd0a1f063\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-3bfb7046-2b59-4a48-9351-641ede9399e2\">1. 겨드랑이 절개</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9244ddb4-e8f6-4ee3-bbd9-8239bde24dd7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-f8cd0be1-3144-4fa1-beb3-151b27d04e80\">2. 가슴 밑선 절개</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-28739b5c-7025-41d2-a0b5-70c92228a7e8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-cccfa945-5018-4916-be53-dc5a37fcef25\">3. 유륜 절개</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-addfeab4-6a64-46bd-bb4f-4d5b23f80336\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-ea4c4986-2c1a-4b9a-a07e-68d9c8fa52cc\">4. 배꼽 절개</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-656c00a8-bee6-43e0-88ab-63d91288459e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-6b879a1e-bb61-4b44-a63d-2b1745aaf55b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e4361930-7f7e-4c34-a968-1792b89f0c2b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-b45d5361-5006-4daf-bedc-d975cf5a1f64\">그러나 배꼽 절개는 생리식염수 백을 사용하던 시기에 주로 시행되었으며, 현재는 실리콘 보형물이 대세가 되면서 거의 사용되지 않는 방법입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-baf48f7a-a5d1-4b91-96e8-d9fae274da32\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-f9c04024-8497-4961-a8b6-a83a651fdc47\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5074cdb5-653a-45e6-842e-b09480595899\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-e4ee20e9-c0af-4393-a1c6-bd3956b2eae5\">이제, 각 절개 방법별 특징과 장단점을 자세히 알아보겠습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-line1\" id=\"SE-34dd154b-6c17-4e98-8768-89560dc62caa\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-horizontalLine se-l-line1 se-section-align-justify\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-horizontalLine\">\n                                <hr class=\"se-hr\" />\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-b95f1a49-91c7-47c2-9f44-d4399f791a0d\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-justify\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-b95f1a49-91c7-47c2-9f44-d4399f791a0d\", \"src\" : \"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTNfMzIg/MDAxNzQxODY5Mjk5NjMz.auxrD2VK8ilDVIYiD3tKFeTEgYBflqolZrVTG0atcXog.IhJygbdF7fehxaMFIpH4WwyRZ5RtkOBHZ4Sxv8TOsE8g.JPEG/DALL%C2%B7E_2025-03-13_21.31.16_-_A_minimalist_and_elegant_medical_infographic_in.jpg\", \"originalWidth\" : \"1024\", \"originalHeight\" : \"1024\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTNfMzIg/MDAxNzQxODY5Mjk5NjMz.auxrD2VK8ilDVIYiD3tKFeTEgYBflqolZrVTG0atcXog.IhJygbdF7fehxaMFIpH4WwyRZ5RtkOBHZ4Sxv8TOsE8g.JPEG/DALL%C2%B7E_2025-03-13_21.31.16_-_A_minimalist_and_elegant_medical_infographic_in.jpg?type=w966\" data-lazy-src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTNfMzIg/MDAxNzQxODY5Mjk5NjMz.auxrD2VK8ilDVIYiD3tKFeTEgYBflqolZrVTG0atcXog.IhJygbdF7fehxaMFIpH4WwyRZ5RtkOBHZ4Sxv8TOsE8g.JPE