le=\"\" id=\"SE-00ff2586-e242-4ccb-b961-8b4299dbb3e0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-7ff3dc43-4aae-4b7e-92fe-900dd7fba102\">현재 전 세계적으로 가장 많이 시행되는 방법 중 하나가 바로 겨드랑이 절개입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3226a5f9-0625-4e57-bcb9-27af9d5ea5eb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-e3c241ef-da4c-4148-b087-414e65c86130\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ceec2841-caf1-4d59-bb66-d9da2d3fa041\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-09d1c715-1748-46bc-b49f-358883b7cbd0\"><b> </b></span><span style=\"color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-f7940c9e-79b7-46c4-aecd-b6504fa121f5\">👉</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-7e552727-a1f9-4de0-96e4-35077b3d9498\"><b>장점</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-32995fe6-79ee-49bb-8a3e-fa75a1a33398\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-d561c5ba-1cc2-4eee-9de6-f18bcdacc9ae\">✔ 흉터가 가슴 부위에 남지 않아 미용적으로 유리</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-aa278b8c-ca43-4f70-bb33-934c601fa3cf\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-8edc6af1-8bf7-4f98-81c5-a457879c3c94\">✔ 겨드랑이 주름과 절개선이 겹쳐져 흉터가 잘 보이지 않음</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9fda4e57-e6dc-41f4-88d1-836371052a59\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-e16b2391-9cc2-4300-8786-c8a5ba83ce6b\">✔ 피부층이 얇아 흉이 적게 남을 가능성이 큼</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-edcfdb7b-77f7-43f6-b1f9-563a8d8ae8ef\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-346c8e99-f951-4584-8cfd-e283941de473\">✔ 부유방 제거가 필요한 경우, 추가 절개 없이 함께 제거 가능</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c69f2ae8-dbbd-4a9c-96c0-800856e0a80f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-4024eff2-f953-4d54-a2cf-bbc73435acd9\">✔ 밑선 박리를 정면으로 직접 보며 진행할 수 있어, 이상적인 밑선(UU라인) 형성에 유리</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-797e1060-b971-44ee-9ffb-806649cb8bba\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-efade254-f7e1-404b-a026-2a3d2884507f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b0032b2f-7ca4-4e9f-a59d-2af683fb51ed\"><span style=\"color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-8cd66b9c-29b9-4daf-958a-3bbfb7115cda\">👉</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-ee96f0b8-04bf-445e-8423-ec5f6b624352\"><b>단점</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9d9391e4-d525-427c-9e49-dead0b38ec2a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-731c0de3-0143-48a2-b8dd-cc92eeefc11a\">✔ 내시경을 이용한 수술이 필수적이므로, 의료진의 숙련도가 중요</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a18e9784-89e3-411b-ab1a-1f5c18a267bd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-00c02725-7ffc-42b4-ae21-ae3e915491fa\">✔ 출혈이 발생하면 지혈이 어려울 수 있음</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-777d377f-d55f-4acb-ac4b-545a32ca36a1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-d2b3db8d-9b43-4296-9ad4-fe3ada61219d\">✔ 수술 후 며칠 동안 팔을 움직일 때 불편함이 있을 수 있음</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d25df1bf-429c-48ae-991c-ca4af76d7583\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-792bfdfa-7d89-44b6-838c-9f2285526ff5\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-431f3fa3-e417-440e-8587-d7c6a5c0a44b\"><span style=\"background-color:#fff8b2;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-52567909-5147-4911-b393-7e2a74cce016\"><b>겨드랑이 절개는 흉터가 보이지 않는 자연스러운 가슴 확대 수술을 원하는 분들에게 적합한 방법입니다.</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-03bcb48e-41dd-4d5f-8f6f-07f0d8c0fef2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-97d6c52c-d726-40fd-8360-f754232729de\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-line5\" id=\"SE-3937ee77-72b3-4c61-8239-ba2ae25c1b28\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-horizontalLine se-l-line5 se-section-align-center\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-horizontalLine\">\n                                <hr class=\"se-hr\" />\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-ca9c8864-6167-4f2f-ae9f-dc137299eff5\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e3f1bdc1-c07f-4a95-99e4-349bed3b5fe1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-46875359-1a9f-4d74-8b49-08e2dc2ff1c3\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d7968112-db5f-4ecf-99d8-4493b3f7330c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-0b6d4346-64a5-4de6-8c5b-5c0e9147ed94\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9f2da814-43a8-4bfe-b5fc-9ccb331f98ee\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffe3c8;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-27168667-da58-4494-a09e-5b05bbcdd5e0\"><b>◎ 밑선 절개 </b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fb42d162-26f3-450f-8831-aff223770561\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-629c82ee-7a0c-4a65-ac17-2436b6e8f7f9\">(수술자가 가장 편하게 진행할 수 있는 방법)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2a4d9dcc-3ae3-4c5c-b9c3-c94ceb176962\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-8775d083-0533-4b2f-8596-1b993f190f24\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3f19d1eb-ded4-4aca-8687-c746fac098d5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-2444eda8-11f0-4a3a-8d97-b9391905b1b3\">밑선 절개는 가슴 아래 주름(밑선)에 보형물을 삽입하는 방식으로, 수술 시야 확보가 가장 용이한 방법입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5796916b-a09c-4efa-b6a2-98d586cd5b2c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-c3dc8ede-53b0-4d7b-a47a-dfdc28646845\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-522fa94d-9858-4e83-834c-c01d36966159\"><span style=\"color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-1d30a722-f58b-46ac-a42e-6d7cbc2471af\">👉</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-b13986ca-5115-4cf7-854f-fbbb48f14f83\"><b>장점</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5842022c-ad7e-4f10-bf3b-e0d9d2982e44\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-88393753-2b67-442d-bceb-ce5b062127e2\">✔ 수술자가 직접 보면서 진행할 수 있어, 수술의 정밀도가 높음</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a3108660-8e18-4ad9-b830-d03ac9dfee1c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-7d6ab9a4-4782-4936-b660-c44121af0690\">✔ 출혈이 발생했을 때 빠르게 대처 가능</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-27766e7d-ed2a-41f2-bb08-946d093bddae\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-37cb3e91-7d07-42ee-99e5-1575b24f8276\">✔ 유선 조직이 발달한 수축형 가슴(타이트한 가슴)에 적합</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-04ce7f51-3719-45b9-a382-ab94d2c83dcd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-4b91cbe6-4b1c-4173-a149-a079770c4ff5\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ccad29ec-0b2c-493e-bba8-f1d6273ae0ad\"><span style=\"color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-784e79d3-a46f-4461-a5d7-01abb79b959c\">👉</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-c3965cb4-bd37-46b7-a686-c0e8fe84bd84\"><b>단점</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-38dc6003-844a-4f5c-a96c-cd523aee3dde\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-4d770f90-e885-411f-9fea-70502e81a568\">✔ 가슴에 직접 절개선이 남아, 흉터가 보일 가능성이 있음</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-54f82276-7b44-4efb-8e31-786c156e02f9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-855e8c45-4bfd-4d18-bf1d-e459e74cc3b4\">✔ 누웠을 때 흉터가 보일 수 있으며, 디자인한 위치보다 보형물이 내려오지 않거나 밑빠짐이 발생할 경우 흉터가 가려지지 않을 수 있음</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e3bb5ead-9587-418b-bc8a-3d5ab67ffd33\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-0566f732-34db-4e52-ab33-2ae2c65c5e0e\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-26cf16ce-4b64-428b-b7f2-ae132a1a59cf\"><span style=\"background-color:#fff8b2;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-5b3db31e-787c-4a24-8240-d4f0263bb51d\"><b>밑선 절개는 절개선을 크게 신경 쓰지 않으며, 보다 안전하고 정밀한 수술을 원하는 경우 고려할 만한 방법입니다.</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-868cf1d2-e042-4760-9de0-b4e48b63dc81\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-61853d1d-f2ed-46a7-8c06-813288797eb0\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-75617756-f995-47ab-82d8-e13cc99e79a8\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-justify\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-75617756-f995-47ab-82d8-e13cc99e79a8\", \"src\" : \"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTNfMTYy/MDAxNzQxODY5NTAzMjQ0.OjgYTcwq6X0TBPKDapd_W9LNlHoTLHM5V_XZI0Rl2ykg.Y8r2ONge5Gp7_nlPtxt_5T9G06qrHFcty__2g1C4vi4g.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"1133\", \"originalHeight\" : \"533\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTNfMTYy/MDAxNzQxODY5NTAzMjQ0.OjgYTcwq6X0TBPKDapd_W9LNlHoTLHM5V_XZI0Rl2ykg.Y8r2ONge5Gp7_nlPtxt_5T9G06qrHFcty__2g1C4vi4g.PNG/image.png?type=w966\" data-lazy-src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTNfMTYy/MDAxNzQxODY5NTAzMjQ0.OjgYTcwq6X0TBPKDapd_W9LNlHoTLHM5V_XZI0Rl2ykg.Y8r2ONge5Gp7_nlPtxt_5T9G06qrHFcty__2g1C4vi4g.PNG/image.png?type=w966\" data-width=\"886\" data-height=\"416\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-d64e8fd5-d405-4cd2-8562-fa59d2c28613\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-75ae583d-70ea-4e9e-9f72-0fe00c8fe9b5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-aa85f8de-d4bc-45fd-a094-44081887d370\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2bcbf813-4e48-4d13-8206-3a8ade908cb1\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffe3c8;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-50766808-5cf0-4f0e-91cf-5cfb84b6040c\"><b>◎ 유륜 절개 </b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-22e82442-38e3-44a5-be6b-84ce58469523\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-67007f11-31bd-4c7c-ae92-f35e1892b416\">(특수한 경우에 적합한 방법)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c2a3594b-9089-4c13-8aa9-583b2ab0b563\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-1421d7b7-52fe-4332-b7a6-079f46f02942\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f4707d3d-e15b-40dd-b23f-33ea0ed1b59b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-1ef51b47-eabc-4bcb-8161-9dcdc6c58e84\">유륜 절개는 일반적인 가슴 확대 수술에서는 선호되지 않는 방법입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b65b51b7-4135-4c75-8790-07c0c3e18642\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-e43bb33a-f93b-4bcc-8e23-b20f98df69c5\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5491bfa0-e861-457d-aad3-64639f52616f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-5783f442-5154-456d-9117-68a7d0e9162d\">✔ 구형구축 발생률이 높다는 연구 결과가 다수 존재</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ec7ae0bc-87ca-4f99-a6ba-08b3574abe7f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-18658cf8-593f-4f5e-a871-d2578f2989a3\">✔ 절개 부위가 작아 시야 확보가 어렵고, 박리가 제한적</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-877e9a0b-750e-4e59-96c0-264c3e45cda9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-f7dfd1c6-28e3-4499-bbe3-dd22eb948854\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-227bf54f-f87b-4c83-9a69-820bd3b74890\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-6e1cef4c-7da6-4bc6-b59f-7062504c1bdd\">하지만 특정 경우에는 유륜 절개가 오히려 유리할 수도 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3156009d-8ab3-494c-ba09-528f402810f7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-0a5897c3-b136-4249-ad50-18d39e77e347\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7228d581-0492-4dfa-b6fa-77a62cdff05f\"><span style=\"color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-afdb5262-1519-44e8-9ee3-b5cf23529791\">👉</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-cab5815a-ac7a-4c9f-96e1-ba9b47c14086\"> 거상 수술(처진 가슴 리프팅)과 병행하는 경우 – 이미 유륜 부위에 흉터가 남기 때문에 추가 절개 없이 진행 가능</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fb0a5d0a-0f68-43e3-ac47-9ae535c7059c\"><span style=\"color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-eae65087-a0e9-49fc-b6a4-d1353041c590\">👉</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-e37209f7-405e-4a92-ab04-c22204d24c84\"> 심한 수축 가슴(타이트한 유선 조직)을 개선하는 경우 – 유선 조직 리모델링 및 유륜 탈장 방지를 위해 선택</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-75e0bc25-db4e-4b61-b5de-e026f955fba5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-7a966a9c-9a8b-492e-95d7-214843803f1c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6b7354f4-23d6-4d43-9754-90ad1d2ee3b2\"><span style=\"background-color:#fff8b2;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-a729b300-8df9-4750-81a5-4ce49e3c17e5\"><b>즉, 유륜 절개는 일반적인 가슴 확대보다는, 특정한 상황에서 필요할 때 선택하는 방법입니다.</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ffd1f910-8d5a-46f4-b763-4deb629cf0a2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-a2aebabe-ac0b-4e25-bda6-ceabe1887724\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-line1\" id=\"SE-7513c56f-065d-403f-b95e-6df6170544b6\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-horizontalLine se-l-line1 se-section-align-justify\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-horizontalLine\">\n                                <hr class=\"se-hr\" />\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-10d0dc8b-4125-42c6-b785-f089a2995507\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cd126e59-27db-4e0b-b45b-6d956f8b41df\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-6b2aa197-995d-4296-a7cf-faa78f114efa\">가장 적절한 절개 방법을 선택하는 것이 중요</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f9a26bed-98e1-43e2-a36b-1a929c68356c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-815b835f-e731-45aa-ae3b-4e2465e1991e\">가슴 확대 수술을 할 때 가장 중요한 것은, 자신의 신체 조건과 원하는 결과에 맞는 절개 방법을 선택하는 것입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b9610db1-23fb-47e1-9cd1-a56f7592b64d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-74dcf034-4432-40b4-9588-a8854791ea5f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e5c532b2-1706-409a-8837-5311baa57ad5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-caa3e379-6f83-491d-901e-02fc08301f33\">본인의 체형과 목표에 가장 적합한 절개 방법을 선택하는 것이, 만족스러운 수술 결과를 만드는 핵심 요소입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ca61cb66-88f1-431e-9cc0-fa8b8b4059e7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-d6ad32c7-6383-489d-8dba-48454c44d8d4\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-309c6c1e-c3ce-45bc-87bc-a34a4c7bba3d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-263a9e0b-5fdd-4e6f-a51e-f9e0276593de\"><b>따라서 수술 전 충분한 상담을 통해 가장 적절한 방법을 결정하는 것이 중요합니다. </b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-d4dfb5ce-26ac-4669-ad08-c4f5becf332f\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-justify\" style=\"max-width:567px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-d4dfb5ce-26ac-4669-ad08-c4f5becf332f\", \"src\" : \"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTlfNzYg/MDAxNzQyMzg3NjkyOTg1.OatrPp6iEhC0yBWivc1lMk1UFfUZUnwKMU2J3JqnaxIg.qSLENpxjEu9WEvgZ1sRbsxtbWKwq0eYejk-3wbyQk4Ig.JPEG/%EC%8A%AC%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%EB%93%9C2.JPG\", \"originalWidth\" : \"567\", \"originalHeight\" : \"567\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTlfNzYg/MDAxNzQyMzg3NjkyOTg1.OatrPp6iEhC0y